          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "exceção comes from Latin exceptiō \"an exception, a restriction\" (EtymDB), on excipere \"to take out\", built on capere \"to take\" (Lewis & Short)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
